{{Passive skill box|Augury of Penitence}}

'''Augury of Penitence''' is a notable [[Ascendancy passive skill]] for the [[Inquisitor]] that grants an [[aura]] that causes enemies to deal less [[elemental damage]] and [[damage taken|take increased elemental damage]]. The radius of the aura is 6.0m.<ref name="Radius"/>

==Ruthless mode==
