|1         = <div class="passive-icon-container passive-icon-type__ascendancy_notable"><div class="passive-icon-frame"></div>[[File:ElementalDomination (Inquistitor) passive skill icon.png]]</div>
|2         = Nearby Enemies take 8% increased Elemental Damage<br>Nearby Enemies deal 8% less Elemental Damage
}}

Augury of Penitence in [[Ruthless mode]] has a weaker damage taken aura against enemies.

